<title>UK: Gilts celebrate Christmas with small gains.</title>
<headline>Gilts celebrate Christmas with small gains.</headline>
<text>
<p>1235 GMT - Gilt futures ended a half-day's trading slightly higher after global and non-EU trade data passed without incident. The futures will trade next on Friday -- another half-day session.</p>
<p>* March gilt settled 3/32 higher at 110-00</p>
</text>
